{"about_the_game":"Lux is a 2D platformer that follows Lou, a girl who discovers a magic lantern in her attic. Full of quirky characters and a whole lot of puns, explore the town of Idelham, and discover the darkness that lurks under the surface. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game features: <br />\r\n- Solve puzzles<br />\r\n- Ton of fun local characters (including many OCs designed by our community!)<br />\r\n- A bunch of mini games<br />\r\n- Unfolding story <br />\r\n- Basic platforming<br />\r\n- Gorgeous frame by frame animation and carefully done background art<br />\r\n- Observe various things<br />\r\n- Unobserve them immediately","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2795150?t=1772684931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772684931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795150/57268a82c24100faff7e2aa5ae256c45bb93f735/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772684931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795150/57268a82c24100faff7e2aa5ae256c45bb93f735/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772684931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Lux is a 2D platformer that follows Lou, a girl who discovers a magic lantern in her attic. Full of quirky characters and a whole lot of puns, explore the town of Idelham, and discover the darkness that lurks under the surface. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game features: <br />\r\n- Solve puzzles<br />\r\n- Ton of fun local characters (including many OCs designed by our community!)<br />\r\n- A bunch of mini games<br />\r\n- Unfolding story <br />\r\n- Basic platforming<br />\r\n- Gorgeous frame by frame animation and carefully done background art<br />\r\n- Observe various things<br />\r\n- Unobserve them immediately","developers":["Emily Prout","Tiffany Bligh","Mathe